window.products.push({"id":77227,"name":"MSDADA Stove Covers, 8 Pcs 0.2 mm 10.6\" x 10.6\" Gas Range Protectors with 2 Pcs 21” Silicone Gap Cover Keep Stove Clean, Double Thickness, Reusable, N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dpEhXbNUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Non-Toxic & Safety: This stove covers is BPA and PFOA free, and does not release a chemical odor when used. We don't want any harmful chemicals to get near you or your food. This gas stove protector can withstand temperatures up to 500 degrees Fahrenheit. Note: These stove gap covers is not hundred percent fire-resistant, so you should avoid direct contact with flames or heating elements to avoid possible injuries, or damaging of the product. Essential Kitchen Gadget: These gas hob protectors are the solution to your messy cooking ways. Lay flat on your stove and make your stove look neat and clean so you can cook without worry. With this gas stove protectors you can now cook without the worry of needing to scrape or scrub. Easy to resize: No need to worry about the different sizes of the stove, this gas stove top covers can be cut with scissors, it can adapt to most stoves of different sizes. Just remove your gas grate, mark it over your protector sheet, fold the stove covers then cut. Easy To Clean & Dishwasher Safe: Easy to wipe off the dripping sauce, charred food, grease. Do not throw it away when the surface is dirty. It is fully reusable on both sides, and also can be easily removed and washed by hot soapy water! Or just throw the dirty stove protector liners in the dishwasher and it will be a new one again. Package Included: There are 8 Pcs Gas Stove Covers + 2 Pcs Silicone Stove Gap Covers(black) in the package, so you can replace them as needed. We have confidence in the quality of All MSDADA products and give you great customer service. If you are unsatisfied with this product for any reason, please email us and we'll offer help until you are satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dpEhXbNUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MSDADA","source_asin":"B09SLP6PDV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-77227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SLP6PDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SLP6PDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
