window.products.push({"id":77400,"name":"OnePurify RFC100A Water Filter Replacement Cartridge for Samsung, Water Sentinel, Aqua Fresh, Swift Green, PUR, Kenmore","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pj8oRreAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This OnePurify refrigerator water filter contains a compressed carbon block that provides tremendous capacity to remove and/or reduce impurities and sediment that may be present in your drinking water. The carbon block has millions of active sites on it's surface and within the structure which can absorb impurities like a sponge, and can adsorb and hold other types of impurities on its surface like a magnet. Additionally this filter can catalytically breakdown other impurities very similar to the way a catalytic converter works in your automobile. These processes ensure that you are getting the cleanest and best tasting water possible. This filter should not be used with water that is micro biologically unsafe or of unknown quality, without adequate disinfection before and or after the filter. This filter has been tested by the manufacturer against ANSI/NSF Standard 42 for the reduction of Chlorine Tastes and Odors.MWF compatible filter removes the following contaminants: 99.30% of Lead at pH 6.5 99.90% of Lead at pH 8.5 94.50% of Mercury at pH 6.5 96.60% of Mercury at pH 8.5 99.92% of Asbestos 89.60% of Benzene 99.90% of P-Dichlorobenzene 99.99% of Cysts 98.70% of Carbofuran 97.00% of Chlorine 99.10% of Turbidity 97.60% of Particulates (Class I) All filters are certified to be free from leaks if properly installed and to function with the latest modifications from the OEM. All components NSF-42/53 certified. The Activated Carbon Block Filter inside has NSF42/53 approval. The quality of the filter is the same or better than the OEM branded filter. Manufactured in an ISO9001 facility. Technical Specifications:MATERIAL: NSF Coconut shell Activated Carbon;MICRON RATE: 0.5 Micron;OPERATING TEMP.: 39-125 degrees Fahrenheit;MAX. OPERATING PRESSURE: 20-120psi;FLOW RATE: 0.8 GPM;FILTRATION LIFE: 6 months/400Gal *Depends on water quality and level of contaminants.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pj8oRreAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OnePurify","source_asin":"B00KC7VZ2I","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-77400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KC7VZ2I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KC7VZ2I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":77401,"name":"Sunnydaze Stainless Steel Beverage and Wine Cooler Single Zone Refrigerator with Sliding Wooden Shelves, Touchpad Temperature Control and LED Light - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":699.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VLs8PHkTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ideal size for smaller wine collections: The wine cooler has 3.04 cubic feet of storage, measures 14.75\" W x 22.25\" D (24\" including the handle) x 34\" H and weighs 73 lbs. The door measures 14.5\" W x 30\" H x 1.25\" thick (1\" thick glass pane). Each shelf measures 11\" W x 17\" D with 1\" lip on the front and back of each shelf. The shelves pull out 5.75\" before the stoppers stop shelf. Additional shelf features include: 1\" slats with 1.25\" gaps; 3\" shelf clearance with 7.25\" clearance on bottom. Durable, modern stainless steel design: This beverage refrigerator features a stainless steel door frame, a bar handle, grill ventilation, layered glass door window, and a touchpad controller with LED display. Additionally, 5 beech wood sliding shelves are removable for easy cleaning. 33-bottle capacity freestanding fridge: The wine cooler accommodates up to 33 bottles of wine (750-ML). It can also accommodate other beverages like beer, soda, water or juice. This fridge is designed to be freestanding but can be installed under the counter with proper ventilation. The adjustable feet help with leveling the fridge. The power consumption for this fridge is 0.880 kWh/24h, 65 watts, and 115 volts. It also features a 56\" L electrical cord. Easy to use single zone: The touchpad temperature control sets the thermostat to the perfect temperature for evenly chilled wines. The minimum temperature is 41 degrees Fahrenheit. The maximum temperature is 68 degrees Fahrenheit. Quiet and low vibration: Advanced compressor technology results in low noise/vibration so wine sediments are less likely to be disturbed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VLs8PHkTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunnydaze","source_asin":"B09YSJPN5P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-77401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YSJPN5P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YSJPN5P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
