window.products.push({"id":77490,"name":"Good Living Eco-Friendly Reusable Coffee Filter for 6-8 Cup Coffee Makers, 4\" Diameter Top, 2.38\" Bottom, 2-pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qSup6JVlL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Making the first cup of coffee of the day is sometimes the one thing that gets busybodies going. When you want to customize the strength and flavor of your cup, you normally have to waste paper filter after paper filter as you make your daily pot. You need a cup that you can fill to your own preference with less waste. This reusable coffee filter is able to make cup after cup instead of having to throw out the filter after each pot. Your coffee comes through with a full-bodied flavor that will keep you going until your lunch break. Between uses, keep it clean by running it through the dishwasher. Get as many filters as you need for the office or home to keep everyone caffeinated and happy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qSup6JVlL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Good Living","source_asin":"B00C7BEB7S","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-77490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C7BEB7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C7BEB7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":77491,"name":"Universal Inline Filter for Refrigerator, Ice Maker, Under Sink Water Filter (3)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BDxnnZaeL._AC_SL1035_.jpg","description":"Install this filter on cold water lines only. Do not use on water lines exceeding 100°F (38°). Minimum water pressure should not decrease below 20psi or exceed a maximum of 125psi. Prevent the filter from freezing. Remove if water temperature falls below 0.6°C (33°F). Avoid exposure of filter housing to external heat or flames. Do not use pipe dope or similar compounds as they can damage the plastic housing. Tubing and hose dimensions are based on outside diameters. For water line sizes other than ¼” consult a plumber or water treatment professional. Keep unit clean with simple soap and water. Do not use insecticides of spray cleaners on or near the unit. When installing behind a refrigerator or appliance, use enough tubing to allow removal of the refrigerator or appliance as well as prevent damage to the tubing, filter, or fittings. Damage to tubing, filter, or fittings could cause leakage and or water damage. The manufacturer recommended to replace every 3 Months but our lab test said that almost 4-5 month's use of water in an average household is fine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BDxnnZaeL._AC_SL1035_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glacier Water Filters","source_asin":"B074YVPHQ3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-77491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074YVPHQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B074YVPHQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
