window.products.push({"id":77532,"name":"W10189077 Washers Suspension Rod Kit 26.6” Length by Beaquicy - Replacement for Whirlpool Ken-more Washing Machine - Package Includes 4 Suspension Rod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KeYW7UApL._AC_.jpg","description":"PRODUCT DESCRIPTION: Washer suspsenion rod kit. This Suspension Rods Support the washing machine washing tub and balance the washing machine under unbalanced conditions to reduce vibration.Commonly found on Whirlpool Cabrio, Bravos, and Ken-more Oasis washing machines. PACKAGE INCLUDE: 4 Pcs*W10189077 W10820048 suspension rods 4 Pcs*ball cups EASY TO INSTALL Tools Needed: Spackle knife and tape Installation Tips: Extremely simple project. Anyone can do this repair. Start by pulling the top of the washer toward you and sliding your spackle knife in the gap under the door about 4 -5 inches off each end. This will release the retaining clips. Then lift the whole top up and tape the door closed so it won't swing back on you. We suggest slipping a chain from the body of the machine to the top part you just loosened so it doesn't swing all the way back. Them simply lift each suspension rod from each corner off the mounting balls and drop the rod down through the hole. At the base of the tub the rod is clipped in, reach down and unclip the rod and it will free it. Insert new rod and make sure new clip clips in securely. Pull rod up through whole and insert new ball. Do that on each corner and your machine will run like new. FIXES THE FOLLOWING SYMPTOMS: Washer was making noise Washer wouldn't stay balanced when spin Cycle WORKS WITH MOST BRANDS :Whirlpoo Ken-more WORKS WITH THE FOLLOWING MODELS NUMBER : Whirlpool: WTW6300SB1 WTW6300SB2 WTW6300SG1 WTW6300SG2 WTW6700TU1 WTW6700TU2 and more. PLEASE NOTE: The brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. Thanks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KeYW7UApL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B082WZB9DT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-77532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082WZB9DT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082WZB9DT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
