window.products.push({"id":77812,"name":"Capresso EC100 Pump Espresso and Cappuccino Machine with Frother and Pitcher Accessory Bundle (4 Items)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+QaquUhaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Perfect the art of brewing espresso with the Capresso EC100 Pump Espresso and Cappuccino Machine . Bundled with your personal countertop barista are accessories that improve the ease with which these caffeinated beverages can be made: a frothing pitcher, a 2 3/4\" tamper and a handheld frother. Lifestyle by Focus bundles are created to meet your lifestyle. Capresso EC100 Pump Espresso and Cappuccino Machine Create new and delicious gourmet coffee beverages quickly and easily in your own home. The EC100 portafilter sieves are pressurized, making it easy to achieve excellent crema even if grind size or tamping pressure isn’t perfect. 15 bars of pressure ensure flavor-rich espresso and the dual frother wand provides powerful steam/froth for delicious milk specialties. Harold Imports 43739 50mm/55mm Kitchen Espresso Handheld Tamper This handheld tamper from Harold Imports is perfect for firmly packing the coffee grounds into the portafilter and creating a hard, even coffee pellet. This tamper features two flat tamping surfaces (50mm and 55mm) and stands 2 3/4 tall. To clean, hand wash with warm water and dry completely. Update International Stainless Steel Frothing Pitcher (20oz) This Update International frothing pitcher holds 20oz of liquid and is made of corrosion-resistant 18/8 gauge stainless steel to ensure a long life even under heavy use. The attached handle stays cool to the touch as you heat the milk and the molded spout on the front of the pitcher prevents spills as you pour the frothed liquid into your cup. Bundle Includes Capresso EC100 Pump Espresso and Cappuccino Machine Capresso EC100 Pump Espresso and Cappuccino Machine Update International Stainless Steel Frothing Pitcher (20oz) Update International Stainless Steel Frothing Pitcher (20oz) Harold Imports 43739 50mm/55mm Kitchen Espresso Handheld Tamper Harold Imports 43739 50mm/55mm Kitchen Espresso Handheld Tamper Knox Handheld Milk Frother Knox Handheld Milk Frother","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+QaquUhaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Capresso","source_asin":"B00P6VSZB4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-77812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P6VSZB4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P6VSZB4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
