window.products.push({"id":77963,"name":"FRIGIDAIRE EFIC189-Silver Compact Ice Maker, 26 lb per Day, Silver (Packaging May Vary)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LbRFIG2TL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you hear the Frigidaire name, immediately you think of quality built, affordable kitchen products. Well the folks at Frigidaire are at it again. Introducing the counter Top Ice Maker! Are you hosting this year’s family BBQ? Well then you better get your hands on this ice maker! The LED design allows you to check the ice level and choose the size of ice cubes you want. The cover with the large see through window makes it easy to see the ice basket and shovel. The air outlet will keep this thing going through the whole party and when it’s time to clean up you can easily empty the ice maker with the drain plug. All this from the makers at Frigidaire, the #1 leader in refrigeration!；The product voltage arrange is 120V","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LbRFIG2TL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRIGIDAIRE","source_asin":"B081JBKY7K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-77963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081JBKY7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B081JBKY7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":77964,"name":"Waterdrop BORPLFTR50 Replacement for Bosch® Ultra Clarity® Pro 11032531, 12033030, 11025825, BORPLFTR55, B36CD50SNS, B36CT80SNS, B36CL80ENS, B36FD50SN","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518M-K2uMnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Waterdrop WD-F15 refrigerator water filter replacement, despite its affordable price, offers the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and important certifications from the well-known regulatory body in the industry – NSF 42 and NSF 372 certificates. Thanks to the 100% Sri Lankan superior coconut shell carbon block, this Waterdrop water filter replacement for Bosch UltraClarity Pro BORPLFTR50 is effective against various materials. [Compatibilty] Compatible with Bosch UltraClarity Pro B36CT80, B36CT80SNS, B36CT80ENS, B36CT81SNS, B36CLSN, B36CL80E, B36CL80SNS, B36CL80ENS, B36CD50, B36CD50SNS, B36CD50SNB, B36FD50SNS, B36IT905NP, B36IT90SNP [Replacement models] Replacement for Bosch UltraClarity Pro BORPLFTR50, BORPLFTR55, REPLFLTR55, REPLFTR50, 12033030, 11032531, 11025825, 12028325, 11041954, 11050659, RA450022 , WFC100MF, WFS200MF [Perfect fit] Waterdrop combines precision measurement technology to perfectly reproduce the original scale parameters with advanced industrial automation equipment. We aim to produce 100%-fit refrigerator filters with an exquisite engineering design, unlike inferior replacement filters that have issues with water leakage. Also, we strive to save your precious time by offering tool-free, no-mess refrigerator filter replacement. [Monthly install stickers] The filter life is 6 months or 300 gallons, which will vary based on the water conditions. Far from achieving high-standard filtration performance, expired replacement filters might cause pollutants to accumulate. Our complimentary set of monthly install stickers allows you to keep track of the filter’s lifespan. [Advance filtration process] If you have been looking for a way to reduce harmful impurities from your drinking water, the solution is here. This water filter replacement for Bosch Ultra Clarity Pro 11032531 effectively filters off something from your water. These include chlorine, taste and odor, and other suspended particles tested by the third-party laboratory. While the impurities are reduced, every beneficial mineral in your water is kept, ensuring that your body functions properly. [Premium filter material] Waterdrop uses 100% selected coconut shell carbon block from Sri Lanka. It contains a 2-times-larger surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon block. Thus, the filter cartridge can efficiently reduce chlorine, turbidity, taste and odor, rust and sediment tested by the third-party laboratory. Asides, we have selected a food-grade filter housing that passed NSF 372 certification for being lead-free. [Fresh-tasting water] The 100% coconut shell carbon block can adsorb more impurities than low-priced and mixed carbon block. The Waterdrop refrigerator filter significantly improves the taste of drinking water to bring you a unique experience. [Be responsible for each product] Each product, or even a small component manufactured by Waterdrop, must pass an extremely high-standard examination to reach the top requirements on the market. These standards don’t end once the filter leaves our factory. Waterdrop will take full responsibility for each filter. Our 24/7 customer service team will provide a water purification solution at any time. [Purified with love] We believe everyone, wherever they are, has the right to drink pure water. We hope to use what benefits us to benefit more people. For every purchase, we donate clean water to children in water-scarce regions in Africa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518M-K2uMnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B07DLQVXRL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-77964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DLQVXRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DLQVXRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
